[232.945246, "o", "> "]
[232.947457, "o", "T-28 has an approved active reindex valid through 2026-09-15, so its bloat check is exempt and the finding is none. A computed bloat ratio that exactly equals its size-class cap is compliant because the policy flags only ratios strictly greater than the cap; for example, T-32 at 0.40 equals its small cap 0.40, while T-12, T-15, and T-34 at 0.20 equal the large cap 0.20.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[232.947845, "o", "MD\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
